				Time="2011-09-01T11:08:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>でさ　オマエ
手合わせ　させろよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:30:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
